# 預設忽略所有本地執行期狀態、快取、憑證與對話紀錄 (secrets/, antigravity/brain/, logs/, bin/ 等)
*

# 1. 核心全域規則與說明文件
!.gitignore
!README.md
!GEMINI.md
!WALKTHROUGH_SWARM_V3_AND_SKILLS.md
!settings.json

# 2. 領域規則與安全攔截 Hooks
!rules/
!rules/*.md
!hooks/
!hooks/*.ps1

# 3. 確定性技能路由器、異質多模型會審閘門與跨機同步腳本
!scripts/
!scripts/*.py
!scripts/*.ps1
!scripts/*.json

# 4. 跨專案經驗記憶庫與 Cursor 全域規則鏡像
!memory/
!memory/*.md
!cursor-rules/
!cursor-rules/*.mdc

# 5. Antigravity 全域工作流
!antigravity/
!antigravity/global_workflows/
!antigravity/global_workflows/*.md

# 6. 全域 217 個 Skills 單一真相來源 (config/skills/)
!config/
!config/skills/
!config/skills/**/

# 放行 Skills 內之純文字規格、參考指南與輕量腳本
!config/skills/**/*.md
!config/skills/**/*.py
!config/skills/**/*.js
!config/skills/**/*.mjs
!config/skills/**/*.ts
!config/skills/**/*.sh
!config/skills/**/*.ps1
!config/skills/**/*.json
!config/skills/**/*.yaml
!config/skills/**/*.yml
!config/skills/**/*.txt
!config/skills/**/*.html
!config/skills/**/*.css
!config/skills/**/*.tsx
!config/skills/**/*.jsx
!config/skills/**/*.svg
!config/skills/**/*.mdx
!config/skills/**/*.sql
!config/skills/**/*.toml
!config/skills/**/*.jsonc

# 強制排除 Skills 內可能存在的虛擬環境、套件依賴與快取目錄
config/skills/**/.venv/
config/skills/**/.venv/**
config/skills/**/venv/
config/skills/**/venv/**
config/skills/**/node_modules/
config/skills/**/node_modules/**
config/skills/**/__pycache__/
config/skills/**/__pycache__/**
config/skills/**/.unlighthouse/
config/skills/**/.unlighthouse/**
config/skills/**/.claude-plugin/
config/skills/**/.claude-plugin/**
config/skills/**/.github/
config/skills/**/.github/**
config/skills/**/.bsk*/
config/skills/**/.bsk*/**
config/skills/**/package-lock.json
